      "created_at": "2018-06-18T00:00:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wife got me a new iPad for Father’s Day so I can finally play sentinels in it without crashing. My old one was that old. I haven’t brought many ios board games for it due to this so looking to get a few good ones.&nbsp;</p><p>currently have:</p><p>dresden files</p><p>tokaido</p><p>sotm</p><p>bottom of the 9th</p><p>legendary</p><p>ticket to ride</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>i am looking for some new ones until terraforming mars and scythe comes out, as well as Handelabra hurried up and makes spirit island, any suggestions?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
